  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「う、うちが堀田さんについて、何か気になるとこ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「せやなぁ。まじめなひとやなって思うけど……あとは特に思い浮かばんわぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「むしろ、うちのほうこそ堀田さんについていろいろ知りたいって思うねんよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「ああ、あと少しでクラス替えもあるのに、けっきょく、たまに話すくらいやったから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「えっ、クラスが変わる前に、みんなで春休みに遊びに行く？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「ええけど……もしかして、企画じたいは前からあったけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「クラスのなかでうちだけがそれを知らんかったとか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「ごめんなぁ。うち、遊びのお誘いとかほとんどきたことなくて……疑心暗鬼になってしもたわぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 45,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 456
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ａ",
    "text": "「とりあえずは春休みまでに、もう少し堀田さんと仲良くしたいなぁ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「ふぁあ……♪　寝てたのに叩き起こさないでくださいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「わたしの安眠を邪魔するなんて、さぞ大変なことが起きたんでしょうね？　天変地異とか～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「……さあやちゃんの様子が最近おかしい、ですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「特に思い当たるところはありませんけど……もしかしたら恋愛とか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「年頃の女の子ですからねぇ、なつみちゃんももたもたしてたら先を越されちゃいますよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「ちょ、ちょっと。そんなに動揺しなくたっていいじゃないですかぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「わたしは別に、そういうこともあるかも、って言っただけですからねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「そういえばさあやちゃん、進路について迷ってませんでしたかぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-eye",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-eye_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「だったらきっと、それが原因なんじゃないですかねぇ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "証言者Ｂ",
    "text": "「……ところでこれ、取材費とか出るんですよねぇ？」"
